    "faq_JCkE3h": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "question_7ff4qt": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What will I learn in this course?",
            "text": "<p>You’ll learn everything from how to build a successful media business, strategies to attract and keep high-value clients, confidently price your services, and master the mindset required for entrepreneurship. Additionally, you’ll gain practical tips on gear upgrades, social media growth strategies, networking secrets, and how to manage and reinvest your earnings for long-term success. It's a complete blueprint for turning your passion into a full-time business.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_JRAgJY": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What makes this course different from others?",
            "text": "<p>Unlike many courses that only focus on theory, this course is built on real-life, hands-on experience. I've walked the path from working a full-time job while in college to quitting and becoming my own boss in a media business that generates six figures. This isn’t just about media creation—it’s about the mindset, strategies, and work ethic that will help you succeed in any niche. Plus, this course is filled with practical advice, not fluff.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_KqjW9C": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need expensive gear to get started?",
            "text": "<p>Nope! You don’t need to break the bank to begin. While gear is important, you’ll learn how to work with what you have and upgrade smartly over time. The focus is on strategy and execution, and I’ll show you when and where it makes sense to invest in better equipment as your business grows.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_BqtHNC": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I access the course on my phone?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely! The course is fully optimized for mobile access, allowing you to learn and apply lessons on the go, from wherever you are.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_RTt3mw": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Will this course help me even if I don’t focus on the automotive niche?",
            "text": "<p>Definitely! While my expertise lies in automotive content creation, the principles and strategies taught in this course apply to any niche. Whether you're in fitness, fashion, lifestyle, or any other industry, you’ll be equipped with the skills needed to build a profitable media business.<\/p>"
          }
        },
        "question_EEprnB": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I really quit my job and make this a full-time career?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, but it takes commitment and hard work. Its up to YOU to get this done. I did it, and I’ll show you the exact steps I took to go from a full-time job to running a successful media business. The course is designed to give you the tools, mindset, and strategies to make this transition possible, as long as you’re ready to put in the effort.<\/p>"
          }
        }
      },
